WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.884
Add a custom image to your sponsored Brands product collection campaign to help tell your brand

00:00:04.884 --> 00:00:05.189
story.

00:00:05.189 --> 00:00:05.800
Here's how.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:11.137
When you're setting up your campaign, you'll find an option in the creative section to include a

00:00:11.137 --> 00:00:11.720
custom image.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.020
From here, add your image, like one showing your product in use.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.037
You can either upload one from your computer or choose from images you've already added to your

00:00:22.037 --> 00:00:22.700
creative assets.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.420
Make any adjustments, then click Done when you're ready.
